  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "Ash waits for Wren's response.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:wait"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "text": "'Past the bridge, second left.'",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["reaction:1"],
    "speaker_id": "23a16730-026d-4ed1-be1b-46575f58a7d7"
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "Wren tries to convey something about the mill stores to Ash, but Ash seems preoccupied, waiting for something or someone.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:communicate", "attempt:wait"],
    "speaker_id": null
  },
  {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "text": "\"Grain and oilskins.\" Ash responds cryptically to Wren's attempts to communicate.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["reaction:1"],
    "speaker_id": "0517d16d-04bf-4a8b-a222-3e04a83b0cd6"
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "Wren tries to engage Ash in conversation, seeking an answer to a burning question.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:communicate"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "action",
    "text": "Ash pauses, giving Wren his full attention.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:wait"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "text": "\"Old Marlow, if the lamp is still lit.\" Ash responds, his voice steady.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["reaction:1"],
    "speaker_id": "329d0df9-91b8-4893-8b1c-85815d38d8a0"
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "Wren attempts to communicate with Ash, asking if the stalls are open yet.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:communicate"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "Ash waits patiently for the second bell.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:wait"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker_id": "1d718374-eef1-4adf-a7fc-9b3cfe1d8d48",
    "text": "\"Stalls open at second bell.\" Ash informs Wren.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["reaction:1"]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "Wren tries to engage Ash in conversation about their upcoming dawn patrol.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:communicate"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "action",
    "text": "Ash, however, seems preoccupied and doesn't respond immediately.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:wait"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "The silence stretches on, punctuated only by the distant sound of waves crashing against the shore.",
    "cited_fact_keys": []
  },
  {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "text": "Wren: 'Ash, are you ready for the dawn patrol?'",
    "speaker_id": "29d2ef26-0de3-4b84-9ae9-10bd22b2e64e",
    "cited_fact_keys": []
  },
  {
    "kind": "action",
    "text": "Ash finally looks up, as if just noticing Wren's presence.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:wait"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "text": "Ash: 'Yeah, I'm ready. Let's go.'",
    "speaker_id": "ace1817a-739a-458d-ad38-cbdbc906cc6c",
    "cited_fact_keys": []
  },
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "text": "The two surfers stand up, ready to make their way to the beach.",
    "cited_fact_keys": []
  },
  {
    "kind": "transition",
    "text": "The scene shifts to the beach, where the first light of dawn begins to break.",
    "cited_fact_keys": []
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "narration",
